{"reviews":[{"id":"B01I605PHS-0","r":2.0,"t":"Not what I expected","x":"I bought the whole kit plus this. It was not at all what the videos and reviews stated.  I used it more than once on my daughters hair who has type 4B and myself I have 3A hair type. Wish I never bought this package at the high cost","h":19,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2016"},{"id":"B01I605PHS-1","r":5.0,"t":"it works","x":"I was able to do my own blowout and finally had bounce and silky straight hair. I been natural for 3 years. A little pea size amount goes a long way","h":15,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2017"},{"id":"B01I605PHS-2","r":1.0,"t":"Not a happy camper!","x":"after receiving this product, I was very disappointed because I was looking for a cream and not a thick shea butter that clumped on my hair when applied. In my opinion, it seems as if they scooped Shea butter in a small container and marked it as a buttershine. Also, when I received my product it looked like someone had stuck their thumb in it and sealed it anyway; that made me a little skeptical. For 18.75, I was looking for something more than a thick greasy like substance (which was yellow) a","h":13,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2016"},{"id":"B01I605PHS-3","r":4.0,"t":"E' TAE. Good Product","x":"Tried the product works to straigthen and smooth my hair and followed the instructions my hair which is thin came out nice. My only problem is I sweat in my head/scalp. The flat iron hair lasted about a week and a half. Love the product. Also the service and shipping was great. Thank you.","h":13,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2016"},{"id":"B01I605PHS-4","r":5.0,"t":"Bought for my granddaughter to use. She wanted a ...","x":"Bought for my granddaughter to use. She wanted a way to straighten her hair without all the chemicals. She loves this product!","h":12,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2016"},{"id":"B01I605PHS-5","r":2.0,"t":"Not for me..","x":"I have been using the E'tate shampoo and conditioner products for a while now and I really like them however, I don't care this particular product. The cream is very hard  and you really have to rub it into my hands before adding it to my hair. I do see some added shine to my hair after using but I can find the same results in other less expensive products.  I will pass on this one...","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B01I605PHS-6","r":5.0,"t":"Love it!","x":"LOVE IT!  Works great in our hair.  Keeps my daughters hair well conditioned.  Helps with the dryness.  Expensive but well worth it.  Wish I could afford a bigger jar.","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2017"},{"id":"B01I605PHS-7","r":5.0,"t":"Shine like no other","x":"Love love love Buttershine. This product gives me the shine without the greasy feeling. You need very little and receive a brilliant shine!","h":7,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B01I605PHS-8","r":5.0,"t":"Great moisturizing product for thick hair","x":"I love this product on my 4C hair. I just hate the container is so small.  This is a great product even though it is expensive.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B01I605PHS-9","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Love it does wonders. Makes me and. My little girl. Hair feel soft healty and great","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2016"},{"id":"B01I605PHS-10","r":5.0,"t":"Great Product!","x":"The product has made  hair more manageable smooth and shiny","h":5,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B01I605PHS-11","r":5.0,"t":"Something New It Works","x":"My first time trying it and I like it. At first I thought that it was just like a lot of products that claims it works for people who sweat in the head and I find that it really does stop it from frizzing up. I just wish the price was a little lower and that you have just something for extremely dry scalp. I have not tried the twist with this product because I have not found any instructions on what and how to use for for the twist out. All in all I like what I have tried so far.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B01I605PHS-12","r":5.0,"t":"It's ok","x":"I use the butter before I flat iron, and I didn't get the shine that I was suppose to get. I think is because I didn't put enough butter on my hair. You suppose to use a little bit. But My hair is thick I can't of put more.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2017"},{"id":"B01I605PHS-13","r":1.0,"t":"Think twice before you buy.","x":"Not sure if it's because it was completely melted and leaking when it arrived but the smell is very offputting. Not to mention it's only 2oz and when it finally hardened back up, it was a little over half full. Not sure if I'll buy the rest of the line after this...","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B01I605PHS-14","r":5.0,"t":"PERFECTION.","x":"This product too, a little goes a long way.  I use a little when using heat products to protect my hair.  It leaves hair shiny and silky.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01I605PHS-15","r":5.0,"t":"It does give your hair a nice shine, and makes your looks good","x":"I use it after I wash my hair. It does what it says. It does give your hair a nice shine, and makes your looks good.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B01I605PHS-16","r":5.0,"t":"Awrsome.. .","x":"Have been looking all over for this product. I am very pleased to recieve it and it is exactly what i expected","h":3,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B01I605PHS-17","r":5.0,"t":"This is thee best stuff I have ever used in my hair","x":"Where do I start?! This is thee best stuff I have ever used in my hair! I simply love it","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B01I605PHS-18","r":4.0,"t":"IT WORKS","x":"Made my hair shiny and smooth but it smells kind of funny.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2016"},{"id":"B01I605PHS-19","r":5.0,"t":"This is something special.","x":"I tried it and on the first try, it soften my hair.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B01I605PHS-20","r":3.0,"t":"Three Stars","x":"The product works okay the smell is awful","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2016"},{"id":"B01I605PHS-21","r":1.0,"t":"Not what I was expecting","x":"[[VIDEOID:c00e81019fd84d215e924f8c18de1c31]] Okay so, when I first got it it was hard as a rock! I thought maybe it was the packaging.. but it's unusable! I'm really upset. Tonight is my second time trying to use it and I want my money back! I've watched other girls videos and it's really like butter in their hands. This is terrible! Like someone tried to make this in their kitchen to pass off as the real deal!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B01I605PHS-22","r":2.0,"t":"Mediocre","x":"Upon first opening the jar, there\u2019s a thumb size print/scoop in the middle of it as if it was used? Not sure but it doesn\u2019t look good. Also, a bit expensive for the amount you get. Tip: It\u2019s a really heavy product so less is definitely more...","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B01I605PHS-23","r":1.0,"t":"Not as seen on FB","x":"This product smells like WD-40 and isn't clear yellow like as shown on FB.  This is cloudy yellow and you can see through it.  Won't be putting this on my hair...Don't waste your money.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2016"},{"id":"B01I605PHS-24","r":5.0,"t":"WONDERFUL LIGHT WEIGHT","x":"Love it. You would think that this would leave a heavy residue on hair, but it is so light weight & smells so good Rosemary, Love this product","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers say the product delivers shine, silky smoothness, and softer, more manageable hair.","cites":[2,4,8,10,11,15]},{"text":"A little goes a long way, according to several reviewers.","cites":[2,8,15]},{"text":"Some reviewers find the product expensive or wish for a larger container.","cites":[7,9,12]},{"text":"Some reviewers complain the cream is hard or thick and clumps, requiring rubbing into hands first.","cites":[3,6]},{"text":"A few reviewers were disappointed with results or received a melted, leaking, or underfilled product.","cites":[1,3,14]}]},"qa":[]}